    "https://www.sfc.edu/why-sfc/careers-at-sfc": {
      "title": "Search sfc.edu",
      "description": "Join Us | St. Francis College Skip to main content Why SFC History & Mission Leadership Board of Trustees Careers at SFC Office of Belonging and Engagement SFC 170 | Five-Year Strategic Vision Mission, Ministry & Interfaith Dialogue Office of Institutional Effectiveness & Accreditation Contact Academics Browse Academic Divisions Business, Accounting & Entrepreneurship Science & Health Science Human Science, Sociocultural Studies & Social Justice Interdisciplinary Studies, Humanities & Education Browse Departments Browse Degree Type A-Z Prior Learning Credits & Equivalencies Career Pathways & Articulation Agreements General Education Program Academic Calendar Faculty Directory Online Learning Study Abroad Course Catalogue Library Grad School Admissions & Aid First Year Transfer International Scholarships & Affordability Student Financial Services Degree Completion Military Apply Now Visit SFC Admissions Calendar Request Information Alumni Alumni Association Affinity Groups Alumni Events Contact Us Alumni Events Dugan Memorial Golf Outing Charter Award Dinner Give to SFC Matching Gifts St. Francis Fund Senior Class Gift Student Life Student Life Accessibility and Accommodations Undergraduate Student Plaza Careers at the Plaza Center for Learning and Leadership ESports Opportunity Programs Student Health Student Community Pledge Campus Safety & Security Residence Life & Housing Purchase SFC Gear Tech Service Desk mySFC Portal The Office of Campus Life Registrar Self-Service Academic Policies News & Events News Social Directory Terrier Newsletter Events Brendan J. Dugan Memorial Golf Outing Charter Award Dinner Franciscan Month Volpe Lecture Series Office of Special Events Request Space Search site for programs, events, and more Make A Gift Apply Online Why SFC History & Mission Leadership Board of Trustees Office of Belonging & Engagement SFC 170 | Five-Year Strategic Vision Office of Institutional Effectiveness & Accreditation Careers at SFC Contact Academics Academic Divisions Business, Accounting & Entrepreneurship Human Science, Sociocultural Studies & Social Justice Interdisciplinary Studies, Humanities & Education Science & Health Science Browse Degree Type A-Z Prior Learning Credits and Equivalencies General Education Program Academic Calendar Course Catalogue Grad School Admissions & Aid Apply Online First Year Transfer International Scholarships & Affordability Degree Completion Military Visit SFC Admissions Calendar Contact Alumni Alumni Association Alumni Events Affinity Groups Give to SFC Contact Us Student Life Student Life Campus Safety & Security Purchase SFC Gear Student Health Mission, Ministry and Interfaith Dialogue Student Accounts Registrar Academic Policies The Office of Campus Life Tech Service Desk ESports News & Events News Social Directory Terrier Newsletter Events Make A Gift Apply Online Search sfc.edu Search Search Why SFC Share Facebook X LinkedIn Email Print Join Us Careers at SFC The heart of St. Francis College is its faculty and staff. These individuals help create an environment of learning and encouragement, Franciscan values and community, and genuine concern for students and each other. This diverse group works for the College for many different reasons. What all our employees share, however, is the satisfaction of ending their day knowing that their individual contributions support a greater and noble cause: giving opportunity to a deserving student who dares to dream big. Explore the possibility of working at St. Francis College by browsing our current Job Opportunities below. Job Opportunities St. Francis College is committed to providing opportunities to all persons without regard to sex, race, creed, color, religion, national origin, citizenship status, age, disability, marital status, gender identity or expression, predisposing genetic characteristics, status as a victim of domestic violence, sexual orientation, status as a Vietnam-era or special disabled veteran, or any other characteristic protected by law in its education programs and activities or employment. The College is an Equal Opportunity employer and we are strongly committed to hiring individuals who are dedicated to academic excellence, and the Franciscan values of compassionate hospitality, ethical leadership, and preparing students to serve and thrive in a global community and shaping a just society. Administrative and Staff Positions Faculty Positions Employee Development Pay and Benefits Administrative and Staff Positions Laboratory Supervisor Laboratory Supervisor Human Resources Coordinator Human Resources Coordinator Brand Production Specialist Brand Production Specialist Undergraduate Support Hub Assistant Director, Academic and Career Development Faculty Positions Faculty Positions Professor and Director of Radiologic Sciences, (Open Rank) Assistant or Associate Professor Nursing OB Peds Department of Nursing, Full-time Faculty (Assistant Professor or Associate Professor or Clinical Lecturer) Adjunct Faculty Adjunct Professor of Biology Graduate Adjunct Faculty (Hybrid position) Employee Development In the same way a St. Francis student benefits from our Franciscan Tradition to develop the whole person, the College makes available to its employees many ways to further their own development. In addition to generous tuition remission and reimbursement programs, our employees attend training and conferences that help further their professional growth. They are also welcome at any of the year-round scholarly lectures hosted at the College. For those who enjoy the connection to our students, we encourage our workforce to support our Division I sports teams, theater productions, concerts and charity events. Relationships made at such occasions often prove just as rewarding for staff as for students. St. Francis College plays an active role in the lives of its employees. From day one, it welcomes them to its rich community where opportunities for learning and advancement abound. Pay and Benefits At St. Francis, we realize that a workforce that is compensated fairly can better focus on the mission of the College. This is why we regularly reference market data to ensure that our salary ranges are consistent with the labor pools in which we compete. We also look at the relationships between the various positions at the College to try and create internal equity amongst the staff. We invite you to peruse our current full-time employee benefits guide below: Benefits Guide Academics SFC Online Student Life Alumni News & Events Apply Now Contact Us Admissions Give to SFC mySFC Portal Careers at SFC Consumer Information Stay Connected X Instagram Facebook YouTube TikTok LinkedIn RSS Visit St. Francis Schedule a Tour Request Space 179 Livingston Street Brooklyn, NY 11201-9902 (718) 522-2300 © St. Francis College, 2020–Present Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Sexual Harassment Assault Response and Education Translate website language The College is in the process of reviewing and updating its website. The website is intended solely to provide general information as of the date of the publication. St. Francis College assumes no responsibility or liability for any errors or omissions and reserves the right to modify any information contained herein at any time. Please direct inquiries to the Office of Marketing & Communications at [email protected] back to top This site uses cookies We use cookies to improve user experience and analyze website traffic. By continuing to use this site, you agree to the use of cookies. Accept"
    },
